	(text "1. U3 MAX3232 at 3.3 V: two RS-232 transmitters and two receivers. Charge pump with C4 ... C8 100 nF (0.1 uF is the datasheet value for VCC 3.0-3.6 V); C7 on V+ goes to VCC as allowed by the datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.146 145.542 0)
